2,\n      5.452,\n  \"critical_path\": {\n    \"from\": \"cpu/u_mem/reg_q.ctrl.reg_write_s0\",\n    \"to\": \"dmem_0_dmem_0_0_0_s\",\n    \"modules\": [\n      \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\",\n  \"fitness\": 12.97,\n  \"cycles\": 4202272,\nRemoving that mux restored median Fmax to 5.452 MHz, with cycles unchanged at 4,202,272. Measured fitness is 12.97 versus 12.12, about 7.0% higher. The 21 pipeline cases and cosimulation pass; the final formal run is still finishing.\n\n[implementation_notes.md](/srv/hwebench/clones/gpt-6-astra_xhigh-v2-rep6/cores/bench/worktrees/hyp-20261003-003-r1s2/cores/bench/implementation_notes.md)\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
