:        res[\"reason\"] = res.get(\"reason\") or (\"; \".join(errs[:3])[:500] or \"no reports written\")\ntools/eval/gowin.py:173:    with eval_slot(\"gowin\"), ThreadPoolExecutor(max_workers=len(options)) as ex:\ntools/eval/gowin.py:175:                          Path(gen_dir) / f\"gowin_p{p}\", env) for p in options]\ntools/eval/gowin.py:200:    \"\"\"`make timing TARGET=<core>`: the vendor timing the evaluator scores,\ntools/eval/gowin.py:214:                                wt / \"cores\" / a.target / \"generated\" / \"timing\", options=opts)\ntools/eval/gowin.py:221:        tr = (wt / \"cores\" / a.target / \"generated\" / \"timing\" / f\"gowin_p{r['place_option']}\" / \"impl/pnr/core_bench.tr\")\ntools/eval/gowin.py:225:        print(f\"  full report: {tr}\")\nfpga/scripts/synth.tcl:50:# -family gw2a: the part is a GW2A-18C; without it synth_gowin maps for its\nfpga/scripts/synth.tcl:52:synth_gowin -top core_bench -family gw2a -json $gen_dir/synth.json\nfpga/scripts/nextpnr_run.sh:26:  --timing-allow-fail \\\ncores/bench/experiments/progress.png\ncores/bench/experiments/log.jsonl\ncores/bench/test/test_imm_gen.py\ncores/bench/test/conftest.py\ncores/bench/test/test_if_stage.py\ncores/bench/test/test_pipeline.py\ncores/bench/test/_helpers.py\ncores/bench/test/test_decoder.py\ncores/bench/test/test_reg_file.py\ncores/bench/test/test_alu.py\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
