{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_18","type":"agent_message","text":"The recovery prototype is slower and violates the existing ten-cycle progress check when a redirected instruction is a divide. I’m dropping that approach. Next I’m testing an explicit bank of register-file flops to keep operand capture separate from Gowin’s inferred block RAM, without adding pipeline cycles."}}
