{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_29","type":"agent_message","text":"Registered recovery still falls short: removing the extra control path shifts the bottleneck to arithmetic, and the added miss cycle costs too much. I’m testing an immediate-recovery version that selects the correction address from the saved prediction, so branch resolution only determines whether recovery is needed."}}
